        Check curated knowledge for Graph change-notifications + Exchange `ApplicationAccessPolicy` behavior; fall back to the researcher subagent (Microsoft Learn / official repos) for anything current/uncertain; memoize findings.
      </pattern>
      <pattern name="Size the delta, do not build it" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Communication/GraphSubscriptionManager.cs">
